2. Solid programming skills, proficient in Go programming, with Modularization design and programming capabilities; familiarity with other programming languages such as C++, Python, or Java is good ;
3. Proficiently master various components and protocols in server-side development, such as Mysql, Redis, Abase, Kafka, Flink, Rpc/Http, etc.;
