- Build modular, reusable components and features;
- Focus on rendering performance in order to ensure superior experience for a heavy interaction platform;
- Continuously work to bolster mobile design and implementation processes in order to improve quality and efficiency;
- Code optimization to improve scalability, reliability, security and performance of mobile applications;
- Collaborate with product design, product management and software engineering teams to deliver best in class user experience.

