- Excellent communication skills;
- Proficiency in both Japanese and English, as this position will be supporting end-to-end procurement and communicate with Japanese vendors as well as internal stakeholders globally;
- Good work ethics and business ethics, impeccable integrity is a must.

Preferred Qualification(s)
- Supporting multiple indirect categories, having procurement process mindset, fully understanding the procurement process and control points, experience in procurement is preferred;
- Strong understanding of the procurement foundation, familiarity with procure-to-pay, end-to-end process and related systems, such as Ariba, Oracle, etc.;
- Result-oriented, attention to detail, strong problem-solving and logical thinking ability.

