1. English can be used as the working language, and be flexible for cross-border business trips and work across time zones;
2. Have the ability to learn new stuff fast, have self-learning awareness, and have a positive work attitude;
3. Have good logical thinking ability, analysis and problem solving ability;
4. Be able to work with a sense of urgency, be able to deal with the needs of multiple parties, and have the ability to plan and deal with priorities;
5. Be proficient in using Microsoft Excel for data processing.

