1. Advantageous to have 5 years of work experience related to payroll operation, and SSC work experience is preferred;
2. Having the ability to use macros, Python and other related applications in data processing to improve efficiency is preferred;
3. Be willing to further extend the work scope in global payroll (especially in non-Chinese Mainland regions).
